PILOT_NOT_CLAIM. **Training is also inherited from the earlier full-scale run and was not re-executed here.** The minimal pilot restores the **epoch-200** checkpoint (2 seeds x {FULL, DROP_C3}); the sealed budget is 2000 epochs and was deliberately *not* used.

Learned arm-seed lineages ran with concurrency 16; external BASELINE seed records were emitted separately. Neutral batches were hoisted once per worker. Each learned lineage completed 2000 source epochs with a checkpoint every 100 epochs; **this report evaluates the epoch-200 checkpoint**.

