The evaluation side is a different failure mode: it can generate small coalitions. In the five evaluated anchors, positive joint candidates existed at size 2 on 3 anchors, sizes 3–5 on 3 anchors each, and size 6 on 2 anchors; nevertheless FULL selected size 100 in all 10 seed-decisions. I’m writing the report with this separation made explicit.
